  "title": "Bronze by gold",
  "html_source": "<p>Bronze and gold refer to the barmaids Lydia Douce of bronze hair and Mina Kennedy of gold hair respectively. Lydia, Mina and another character, a prostitute, are parallels to the three <strong><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siren\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">sirens</a></strong> in <strong><em><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odyssey\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">The Odyssey.</a></em></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://images.rapgenius.com/d66c6ffdc96d67788d2ad21acda3ee4a.470x400x1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p><p>Throughout the chapter, Miss Douce is referred to as bronze and Miss Kennedy as gold.</p>",
